Z||000006||Tabs||08-25-2001||11:15 AM||||The place that Godsend is talking about that does the v8 eliminator swap is call HTD( High-tech development Inc). There located at 5890 Dixie Road Unit 3, Mississauga. There number is 905-670-7337 or check out there website at <A HREF="http://www.hi-techdev.com" TARGET=_blank>www.hi-techdev.com</A>  but theres not that much info on the site.<P>Tabs||||reg||1
